<title>USA: Fannie Mae to redeem $600 mln of debentures.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae to redeem $600 mln of debentures.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Federal National Mortgage Association, Fannie Mae, said Friday that on June 10, it will redeem all $600 million of outstanding Series SM-2002-F, 7.80 percent debentures due June 10, 2002.</p>
<p>The redemption price of the debentures will be 100 percent of the principal, plus accrued interest to the date of redemption.</p>
<p>Fannie Mae is a congressionally chartered, shareholder-owned company and the nation's largest source of funds for home mortgages.</p>
</text>
